namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamClipMask {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask
    src   "A mask on a clipping widget's clip: a shape inscribed in the clip rect, feathered, multiplied by a texture's channel or\na procedural pattern mapped through a threshold, and optionally inverted. It clips the widget's whole subtree, on every\npath that draws it (the built-in shader, the UI materials, world space, render layers and perspective scopes), because\nit is evaluated in the clip's own frame -- the frame the clip rect is.\n\nA mask at its defaults is no mask: the clip is the plain rect it always was, costing nothing more (IsActive)."
    text  "裁剪控件裁剪区域上的遮罩：一个内接于裁剪矩形的形状，带羽化，乘以纹理的某个通道或\n经阈值映射的程序化图案，并可选地反转。它会裁剪控件的整个子树，覆盖绘制它的每条\n路径（内置着色器、UI 材质、世界空间、渲染层和透视范围），因为\n它是在裁剪自身的坐标系中求值的——即裁剪矩形所在的坐标系。\n\n默认设置下的遮罩等同于没有遮罩：裁剪就是原本那个普通矩形，不会带来额外开销（IsActive）。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:bInvert {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:bInvert
    src   "Shows what the mask hides and hides what it shows -- outside the clip rect included: a cut-out, such as a spotlight."
    text  "显示遮罩所隐藏的内容，隐藏它所显示的内容——包括裁剪矩形之外的部分：即挖空效果，例如聚光灯。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:bReverse {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:bReverse
    src   "Runs the texture's or pattern's value the other way: v becomes 1 - v before the threshold. A linear gradient from right\nto left, a radial one from the edge in, a clock wipe anticlockwise. Unlike Invert it leaves the shape and what is\noutside the clip rect alone."
    text  "反转纹理或图案的值：在阈值处理之前，v 变为 1 - v。例如，从右到左的线性渐变、从边缘向内的径向渐变、逆时针的圆形渐变。与 Invert 不同，它保持形状以及遮罩裁剪矩形范围之外的内容不变。\n\n在默认状态下，遮罩是一个简单的矩形，不会产生额外的开销（IsActive）。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:Feather {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:Feather
    src   "Pixels over which the mask fades in from its edge. A Rect fades each side in over its own width, measured inwards;\nevery other shape uses Left for the whole outline, centred on it."
    text  "遮罩从其边缘向内淡入的像素数。矩形每条边按自身的宽度向内淡入；\n其他形状对整个轮廓使用 Left，并以轮廓为中心。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:Frequency {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:Frequency
    src   "Stripes, squares or noise cells across the clip."
    text  "纹理或图案的条纹、方块或噪声单元在遮罩范围内分布。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:InnerRatio {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:InnerRatio
    src   "A star's inner corners, or a ring's hole, as a share of the outer size."
    text  "星形的内角或环形的孔径，表示相对于外径的比例。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:Offset {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:Offset
    src   "Moves the texture or pattern, in its own coordinates (1 is its whole width or height)."
    text  "纹理或图案在自身坐标中的偏移量（1 表示其完整宽度或高度）。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:Rotation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:Rotation
    src   "Degrees clockwise the texture or pattern is turned about the clip's centre: a linear gradient's angle."
    text  "纹理或图案围绕遮罩中心的顺时针旋转角度（线性渐变的角度）。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:Roundness {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:Roundness
    src   "A polygon's corners rounded by this many pixels."
    text  "多边形的角点圆角程度（以像素为单位）。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:Scale {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:Scale
