DreamClipMask:Sides {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:Sides
    src   "A polygon's sides, a star's points."
    text  "多边形的边数，星形的顶点数。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:Texture {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:Texture
    src   "The mask texture. Two texture masks at most take effect along one chain of clips (the outermost two); a third is\nignored, with a warning. A draw call binds one texture per slot, so content under different mask textures is drawn\nin different draw calls."
    text  "遮罩纹理。沿一条裁剪链最多只有两个纹理遮罩生效（最外层的两个）；第三个会被\n忽略并给出警告。一次绘制调用每个槽位绑定一个纹理，因此不同遮罩纹理下的内容会在\n不同的绘制调用中绘制。"
    state machine
}

DreamClipMask:Threshold {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIClipMask.h#DreamClipMask:Threshold
    src   "The source value v becomes saturate((v - Threshold + Softness) / (2 * Softness)): at 0.5 and 0.5, v as it is. A\nsmall Softness turns it into a cut at Threshold, and driving Threshold makes wipes and dissolves."
    text  "源值 v 变为 saturate((v - Threshold + Softness) / (2 * Softness))：当 Threshold 和 Softness 均为 0.5 时，v 保持不变。较\n小的 Softness 会使其变为在 Threshold 处的硬切，而驱动 Threshold 可实现擦除和溶解。"
    state machine
}

